Qubitcoin is an unofficial educational peer-to-peer cryptocurrency.

It is not Bitcoin, not affiliated with Bitcoin Core, and not the 2024 Qubitcoin
(QTC) quantum-proof-of-work network or any Dilithium fork using a similar name.

No premine. No sale. No admin key. Demo difficulty is easy. Do not store value.

Wallet private keys are not included in this repository. Anyone with a wallet.json
can spend that node's coins.
